            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[color:var(--fg)] leading-tight">186 Precision Utilities &amp; Calculators</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[color:var(--muted)]">Free, 100% private, and instant browser-computed</p>
