          <p class="text-[11px] text-[color:var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">Merge, split, compress, reorder, extract text, rotate &amp; protect PDFs.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-[color:var(--fg)]">Open Suite →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
